OL,15,G0900 Inside the Tower of London
OL,16,     FThe Queen's Platinum Jubilee kicks
OL,17,     Foff with the Tower's longest gun
OL,18,     Fsalute in centuries. And as the
OL,19,     Fconstable prepares to retire, he
OL,20,     Ftakes part in the lighting of the
OL,21,     FJubilee beacon.
