OL,5,G0955 Inside the Tower of London
OL,6,     FAs the death of Queen Elizabeth II
OL,7,     Fis announced, the Tower enters a
OL,8,     Ftwo-week official period of
OL,9,     Fmourning. And plans are made for a
OL,10,     Fbig retirement event for the
OL,11,     Fdeparting constable.
OL,12,G1055 Inside the Tower of London
OL,13,     FThe fortress prepares to make
OL,14,     Fimportant changes to mark the new
OL,15,     FKing's reign. Preparations are
OL,16,     Falso made for the installation of
OL,17,     Fthe new Constable of the Tower.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/9
